A.teach("e2-c8-standard-1-write","c8-1-core","Distinguish displacement, rotation, and strain. Give one geological example of each.","Displacement moves a rock from one position to another, as along a fault. Rotation changes orientation, as a once-horizontal bed tilts. Strain changes internal shape or size, as once-round pebbles become flattened.",["Defines displacement and gives a fault-motion example.", "Defines rotation and gives a tilted-bed example.", "Defines strain as a size or shape change.", "Gives a flattened-pebble or other supported strain example."],["TB8:8.1"],{"examId": "exam2", "mock": false, "topics": ["E2C8S1"], "focusedWriting": true});
