A.teach("e2-c8-standard-3-write","c8-3-core","Explain three ways joints form and distinguish a joint from a fault.","Cooling contraction, unloading during erosion, and tectonic stresses can all form joints. A joint is a crack with little shear displacement; a fault has relative slip along the fracture.",["Explains cooling contraction.", "Explains unloading.", "Names tectonic stress as another mechanism.", "Contrasts little joint slip with fault displacement."],["TB8:8.3"],{"examId": "exam2", "mock": false, "topics": ["E2C8S3"], "focusedWriting": true});
